/*!

*\page enable_debug Enable Debug Log
*
* This command enables the debug log messages via RS232. The system might run slower due to the slowness nature of RS232<BR>
* This command enables debug log messages via RS232. The system might run more slowly because of the limited speed of RS232.<BR>
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
*<B> enable_debug</B><BR>
*
*<span style='color:blue'><em><B>
*Example:
*</B> </em> </span><br>
* enable_debug;			&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'>  rem enable debug messages.</span><br>
* disable_debug;		&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;  <span style='color:green'>  rem disable debug messages.</span><br>
*
*/
